# The slot of each module: its RAM cell (include/xip.h, XIP_DMOD_STATIC_SLOTS = 16) and, on ESP32 and ESP32-S3, its 64 KiB link window.
# Format: name start [span], span defaults to 1. Consecutive ranges must not overlap.
# Only the first slot supplies the RAM cell; span reserves code/data windows.
# Unique across modules. It is NOT the flash page: any free page of the module partition holds any image (docs/abi.md, "Versions and pages").
# Changing a slot changes the image: every deployed copy of that module must be rebuilt and reinstalled.
# This is due to Xtensa lacking PIC support.
mod_con    0
mod_flash  1
mod_hw     2
mod_lora   3
mod_disc   4
mod_nan    7 2
mod_rtest  5
mod_ble    6
mod_quic   9 4
mod_system 13
mod_berry  14 2
